      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "The pen shown in your screenshots is a prefab I made using a particle emitter and an animator, which is all done locally and not currently able to be properly synced. The issues you're seeing are due to remote player movement being affected by framerate and network performance, as well as a minor delay in triggering the animation to draw. There may be better solutions when Udon is added, but for now the most reliable pens are the ones in the Presentation Room. Pens on avatars and in user-made worlds will often require you to draw slower to be readable.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
