      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{59b80cbbd1662e660835c7c5|full_name}: You are right with \"old\" Presentation Room pencils. They works pretty good. But most rooms with added pencils are still worst. Even \"new\" Presentation Room Plus is still bad with dotted version pencils. (i heard the owner of the room made a mistake and has not fixed it.) That is why most people ignored the new version room.\n\nWhy are so many rooms so bad? Both line-type and dotted-type pencils are poor visible for other players. Are they also affected by player performance like finger trail?\n\nI am aware the avatars with own finger trails depends on fps and network. In busy rooms, they will more unreadable than in less busy or empty room.",
      "viewerReactions": null
    },
