  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "It's nice some rooms have pencils / pens....\nBUT!!!!!\nThe synchronisation between players seems very bad. What you write on the screen came out for others just a bunch of unreadable pieces of lines or dots.\n\nThe Presentation Room Plus is also useless, it uses dot type pencils. So if you write it fast, it's completely unreadable for others.\n\nOnly old Presenation Room seems have good syncing to other players, most are visible and very low loss.\n\nActually, finger trails share same syncing problem, what i write in the air is not \"nice\" shaped for others players. If other players has more lag (busy room) it will just show bunch of lines... nothing readable.\n\nIt's a shame the syncing is not good for most pencils and even finger trail writing.\n\nTo keep it readable for others, i must write slow and/or in big letters.\n\nIt's part of communication in VRChat and mute streamers use them many times, also for deaf and bad hearing players - so try make syncing best as possible, even with lagging.",
